{
  "name": "AI Sales Research & Opportunity Scoring - Aevora",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a3b1c2d0-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "aevora-research-trigger",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "aevora-research-trigger",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "firstEntryJson",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "eQMpPTdYlqA3dAdw",
          "name": "Aevora Integration Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b1c2d0-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When clicking \"Execute Workflow\"",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b1c2d0-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Prepare Research Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first()?.json || {};\nconst companyId = item.companyId || item.body?.companyId || '';\nconst limit = item.limit || item.body?.limit || 10;\nconst leadIds = item.leadIds || item.body?.leadIds || [];\nconst forceRefresh = !!(item.forceRefresh || item.body?.forceRefresh);\nconst icpConfig = item.icpConfig || item.body?.icpConfig || null;\nconst apiUrl = item.apiUrl || item.body?.apiUrl || 'http://127.0.0.1:13000';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    companyId,\n    limit,\n    leadIds,\n    forceRefresh,\n    icpConfig,\n    apiUrl,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b1c2d0-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Execute AEVORA Sales Research & Opportunity Scoring",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        820,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.apiUrl }}/automation/webhook/research",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "x-company-id",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"leadIds\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.leadIds) }},\n  \"limit\": {{ $json.limit }},\n  \"forceRefresh\": {{ $json.forceRefresh }},\n  \"icpConfig\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.icpConfig) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "eQMpPTdYlqA3dAdw",
          "name": "Aevora Integration Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b1c2d0-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 420,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "# AEVORA Automation #3: AI Sales Research & Opportunity Scoring\n\nThis orchestrator receives research trigger requests from AEVORA, validates tenant context, and delegates research to the AEVORA Sales Research Engine.\n\n- Zero-Cost Local Inference: Ollama qwen2.5:7b\n- Deterministic Opportunity Scoring Engine (5 weighted components: 25%, 25%, 20%, 15%, 15%)\n- Company Isolation: Verified at API boundary via x-company-id and Integration Key\n- Persistence: SalesLead.metadata.researchBrief, QualificationRecord (AI_AGENT), LeadGenAudit\n- Zero Data Retention: saveDataSuccessExecution: none"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Research Request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "When clicking \"Execute Workflow\"": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Research Request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Research Request": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Execute AEVORA Sales Research & Opportunity Scoring",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveManualExecutions": false,
    "saveExecutionProgress": false
  }
}